y comply with the orders, and that: (i) any senator may move to take note of the explanation, and (ii) any such motion may be debated for no longer than 30 minutes, shall have precedence over all other business until determined, and senators may speak to the motion for not more than 5 minutes each. Sue Lines The question is that general busi","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-10328","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2026-06-24/2"}
